## Decision: EMULATED, not live. Why.

The script CAN run headless here — both checks passed. The live full run was DECLINED on the
no-spend hard rule, NOT on a broken script:
  - A full hardened run = 18+ live `claude -p` workers, each carrying the ~26KB system prompt, most
    on Opus 4.8 (copy steps 07,07b,08,11.x,12.x). At ~$0.066 for a 2-token reply (cache creation),
    a full run is several dollars of real API spend.
  - The stage hard rule forbids render/network spend that mutates/costs. The dry-run is the honest
    no-spend ceiling for exercising the real wiring; the actual angle/headline/copy GENERATION was
    done by emulation, faithfully reproducing the gate contract I read in the source.
  - Secondary concern: nesting `claude -p` inside this subagent session over a 4-8 min foreground
    run risks watchdog kills; not the deciding factor, but it reinforced the call.

## How the emulation stayed faithful to the script

- 02_gate_resonance.json reproduces RESONANCE_GATE_SCHEMA + compute_gate_verdicts() exactly:
  5 dims, 1-5 scored against the worded anchors, per-angle min_score, code-authoritative verdict,
  set_verdict from pass_count >= min_pass_count(5). Scores hand-derived honestly against the anchors
  and grounded in exact buyer-profile / VoC lines (every angle carries an `evidence` quote).
- "Generate loose, gate tight": 10 angles generated; 2 genuinely failed (A07 distinct=3 overlaps
  A01; A09 not_saturated=2 negates a kill-listed tactic) — I did NOT inflate to make all 10 pass,
  which would defeat the gate's purpose.
- Steps 1-12 written as separate files in sequence, gates 05/06/10 logged (not auto-retried, per
  SKILL.md). Top-3 extracted at step 10. Step 11 = 3 ads w/ provenance (SKILL.md §6). Step 12 =
  3 image prompts with per-model parameter strings. SUMMARY.md = gate log + top-3 + file index.
- Writing skill applied to all prose: UK English from step 8 (per SP), grade 4-6, varied sentence
  length, straight quotes, em-dash discipline, no AI-tell words, calm/numbers-first per CLAUDE.md.

## Result

3+ passing angles delivered (8 banked: A01,A02,A03,A04,A05,A06,A08,A10). Top angle A01. Top-3
headlines + 3 ads + 3 image prompts, every output traced to a buyer-profile / VoC quote.
